  - En runde starter. Du ser med.
  - "En runde starter. Du ser p\xE5."
  - "Er\xE4 alkaa. Sin\xE4 katsot."
  - "K\xF6r indul. Te most n\xE9zel."
  - "Za\u010D\xEDn\xE1 kolo. Jen se d\xEDv\xE1\u0161."
  - "Tur ba\u015Fl\u0131yor. \u0130zliyorsun."
  - "\xCEncepe o rund\u0103. Tu prive\u0219ti."
  - "V\xE1n m\u1EDBi s\u1EAFp b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u. B\u1EA1n \u0111ang xem."
